e of new user id creation and deletion for respective agents.  ',54,'2021-10-20 09:39:25','2021-10-20 04:09:25'),(531,55,0,93,1,85,'Files need to be reupload ',54,'2021-10-20 09:42:22','2021-10-20 04:12:22'),(532,69,0,93,1,85,'Files need to reupload ',54,'2021-10-20 09:44:23','2021-10-20 04:14:23'),(533,70,0,93,1,85,'File need to reupload ',54,'2021-10-20 09:45:03','2021-10-20 04:15:03'),(534,81,0,93,1,85,'File need to reupload ',54,'2021-10-20 09:46:06','2021-10-20 04:16:06'),(535,82,0,93,1,85,'Only one file is properly uploaded which is related to Enterprise IT Risk Management Process.\nYou need to reupload the file for RA of our process ',54,'2021-10-20 09:47:54','2021-10-20 04:17:54'),(536,79,0,93,1,85,'All in-scope infra assets were already reviewed for PCI DSS compliance. USA assets in Wilkes Barre AOC and India assets in MHE AOC. AOC attached.',93,'2021-10-20 14:33:46','2021-10-20 09:03:46'),(537,46,0,93,1,85,'All authentication requests to infrastructure assets (network devices, servers and workstations) are being fulfilled through Single Sign-On (SSO) which is provided by OKTA platform. Relevant OKTA platform has been reviewed earlier. Network devices are accessed through TACACS/ISE servers for which evidences are uploaded. ',93,'2021-10-20 14:56:48','2021-10-20 09:26:48'),(538,47,0,93,1,85,'All authentication requests to infrastructure assets (network devices, servers and workstations) are being fulfilled through Single Sign-On (SSO) which is provided by OKTA platform. Relevant OKTA platform has been reviewed earlier. Network devices are accessed through TACACS/ISE servers for which evidences are uploaded. For sample assets, TLS 1.2 / ssh v2 configuration has been reviewed during the remote IT audit. Evidences taken have been uploaded.',93,'2021-10-20 14:56:48','2021-10-20 09:26:49'),(539,64,0,93,1,85,'As mentioned, all assets have been reviewed for PCI compliance and AOC documents have been uploaded for your reference. Sample logs for these assets will be