t of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:26:46'),(1094,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:26:52'),(1095,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:27:23'),(1096,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:27:10'),(1097,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:27:30'),(1098,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:27:36'),(1099,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:27:05'),(1100,11,'ISO Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and type setting industry. ','1','2018-11-17 00:00:00','2018-11-21 23:27:00'),(1101,1,'Do you install and maintain a firewall configuration to protect cardholder data?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1102,1,'Are default system passwords and security settings changed before system use?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1103,1,'Is your firewall rule set reviewed at least every six months?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1104,1,'Do you restrict traffic between untrusted networks and cardholder data environments (CDE)?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1105,1,'Is wireless access secured and encrypted?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1106,1,'Is cardholder data encrypted when stored?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1107,1,'Do you use strong cryptography to protect cardholder data during transmission?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1108,1,'Is PAN (Primary Account Number) masked when displayed (showing only last 4 digits)?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1109,1,'Do you securely delete cardholder data when no longer needed?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1110,1,'Are encryption keys managed securely?','2','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1111,1,'Do you use antivirus software on all systems commonly affected by malware?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1112,1,'Is antivirus software kept up to date?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1113,1,'Do you deploy security patches within one month of release?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1114,1,'Do you perform regular vulnerability scans (internal & external)?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1115,1,'Do you conduct penetration testing at least annually?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1116,1,'Do you restrict access to cardholder data based on business need-to-know?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1117,1,'Are unique IDs assigned to each user before allowing system access?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1118,1,'Is multi-factor authentication used for remote access to the CDE?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1119,1,'Are user access rights reviewed at least every six months?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1120,1,'Are terminated users’ access rights revoked immediately?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1121,1,'Do you track and monitor all access to network resources and cardholder data?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1122,1,'Are audit logs enabled on all critical system components?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1123,1,'Are audit logs reviewed daily?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1124,1,'Is time synchronization enabled across all system clocks?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1125,1,'Is file integrity monitoring (FIM) deployed on critical system files?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1126,1,'Do you have a documented information security policy?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1127,1,'Is the policy reviewed at least annually?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1128,1,'Do you provide PCI DSS security awareness training to employees?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1129,1,'Do you maintain an incident response plan?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1130,1,'Is the incident response plan tested at least annually?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1131,1,'Do you segment your cardholder data environment (CDE) from other networks?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1132,1,'Are strong passwords enforced (min. 12 characters, complexity)?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1133,1,'Is remote access via VPN encrypted and secured?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1134,1,'Do you limit physical access to cardholder data?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1135,1,'Do you maintain visitor logs for access to sensitive areas?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1136,1,'Is sensitive media (backup tapes, USBs) physically secured?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1137,1,'Are background checks performed on employees with CDE access?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1138,1,'Do you use intrusion detection/prevention systems (IDS/IPS)?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1139,1,'Is wireless scanning conducted to detect rogue devices?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1140,1,'Are system security configurations hardened based on industry standards (CIS, NIST, etc.)?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1141,1,'Do you maintain PCI DSS compliance documentation?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1142,1,'Is third-party service provider PCI DSS compliance verified annually?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1143,1,'Do you restrict custom application code to follow secure coding practices?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1144,1,'Are change control procedures documented and followed?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1145,1,'Is sensitive data anonymized or tokenized when possible?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1146,1,'Do you classify and label sensitive data properly?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1147,1,'Are encryption algorithms reviewed for industry acceptance (e.g., AES, RSA)?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1148,1,'Do you conduct annual risk assessments related to cardholder data?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1149,1,'Is cloud service provider security regularly assessed?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31'),(1150,1,'Is PCI DSS compliance reported to management on a regular basis?','1','2025-09-19 11:23:31','2025-09-19 05:53:31');
